<rml>
<head>
    <title>Racing HUD</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <style>
        /* Over the game: nothing here takes clicks. */
        body { pointer-events: none; }
        /* Each player: place and lap in the top left of their view... */
        .top { position: absolute; width: 230dp; padding: 10dp 14dp; margin: 18dp 0 0 22dp; border-radius: 10dp;
               background-color: #0b0f1ccc; border-left: 3dp #56a8ff; }
        .top .name { font-size: 12dp; letter-spacing: 2dp; color: #aab3cc; }
        .top .place { font-size: 30dp; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; }
        .top .lap { font-size: 16dp; color: #e8ecf4; }
        .top .best { font-size: 13dp; color: #aab3cc; }
        .top .status { font-size: 13dp; color: #ffcf5c; margin-top: 4dp; }
        .top .drift { font-size: 13dp; color: #aab3cc; margin-top: 4dp; }
        .top .drift span { font-size: 22dp; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; }
        /* ... speed, gear, revs and damage in the bottom right. */
        .dash { position: absolute; width: 230dp; padding: 10dp 14dp; margin: 0 22dp 64dp 0; border-radius: 10dp; background-color: #0b0f1ccc; }
        .dash .speed { font-size: 40dp; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; }
        .dash .unit { font-size: 13dp; color: #aab3cc; margin-left: 4dp; }
        .dash .gear { float: right; font-size: 40dp; font-weight: bold; color: #56a8ff; }
        .dash .label { font-size: 11dp; letter-spacing: 2dp; color: #7f8aa8; margin-top: 4dp; }
        .bar { height: 10dp; margin: 3dp 0 2dp 0; border-radius: 5dp; background-color: #26304d; }
        .fill { height: 10dp; border-radius: 5dp; }
        .redline .rpm .fill { animation: 0.12s linear infinite alternate blink; }
        .low .hp .fill { animation: 0.4s linear infinite alternate blink; }
        @keyframes blink { from { opacity: 1; } to { opacity: 0.35; } }
        /* This moment: "Perfect shift", "+1250", "TOTALLED"; the drift combo. */
        .top .combo { font-size: 22dp; font-weight: bold; color: #ffcf5c; margin-top: 2dp; }
        .top .note { font-size: 18dp; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; margin-top: 2dp; }
        /* The running order. */
        #order { position: absolute; right: 22dp; top: 22%; width: 210dp; padding: 8dp 12dp; border-radius: 10dp; background-color: #0b0f1ccc; }
        .row { display: block; font-size: 14dp; color: #e8ecf4; padding: 2dp 0; }
        .row.you { color: #ffcf5c; font-weight: bold; }
        .row.out { color: #7f8aa8; }
        .row .p { display: inline-block; width: 24dp; color: #aab3cc; }
        .row .dot { display: inline-block; width: 10dp; height: 10dp; border-radius: 5dp; margin-right: 6dp; }
        .row .g { float: right; color: #aab3cc; font-size: 12dp; }
        #banner { position: absolute; top: 30%; left: 0; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
        #banner .big { font-size: 80dp; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; }
        #banner .sub { display: inline-block; font-size: 18dp; color: #e8ecf4; margin-top: 6dp; padding: 4dp 14dp; border-radius: 8dp;
                       background-color: #0b0f1caa; }
        /* The drag strip's tree: three ambers, then green (or red). */
        #tree { position: absolute; top: 14%; left: 50%; width: 90dp; margin-left: -45dp; padding: 10dp; border-radius: 12dp; background-color: #05070ee6; }
        #tree .bulb { display: block; width: 56dp; height: 56dp; margin: 6dp auto; border-radius: 28dp; background-color: #2a2f3d; }
        #tree .amber.on { background-color: #ffb020; }
        #tree .green.on { background-color: #39e36b; }
        #tree .red.on { background-color: #ff3b30; }
        #results { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 46%; width: 640dp; margin-left: -320dp; padding: 10dp 16dp; border-radius: 12dp;
                   background-color: #0b0f1cdd; }
        #results .r { display: block; font-size: 15dp; color: #e8ecf4; padding: 2dp 0; }
        #results .place { display: inline-block; width: 34dp; color: #aab3cc; font-weight: bold; }
        #results .dot { display: inline-block; width: 10dp; height: 10dp; border-radius: 5dp; margin-right: 8dp; }
        #results .who { display: inline-block; width: 200dp; }
        #results .what { display: inline-block; width: 110dp; font-weight: bold; }
        #results .note { color: #ffcf5c; font-size: 13dp; }
        #notice { position: absolute; top: 8dp; left: 20%; width: 60%; text-align: center; font-size: 13dp; color: #ffcf5c; }
        #hint { position: absolute; left: 8%; bottom: 14dp; width: 84%; padding: 6dp 10dp; border-radius: 8dp; background-color: #0b0f1cbb;
                text-align: center; font-size: 13dp; color: #cfd6e6; }
        #hint img, #banner .sub img { font-size: 15dp; } /* prompt glyphs are 1.6em */
        /* On a touch screen the hint's prompts are buttons (docs/INPUT.md), and so is the how-to's Start. */
        #hint, #howto { pointer-events: auto; }
        /* Phones (docs/INPUT.md "Phone, PC and console"): the touch zones
           under the thumbs, the running order only when there's room. */
        #touch { display: none; }
        body.kke-phone #touch { display: block; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: 100%; height: 30%; }
        #touch div { position: absolute; bottom: 0; height: 100%; border-top: 1dp #ffffff33; font-size: 13dp; letter-spacing: 2dp;
                     color: #ffffff66; text-align: center; padding-top: 8dp; }
        #touch .steer { left: 0; width: 50%; }
        #touch .brake { left: 50%; width: 25%; border-left: 1dp #ffffff33; }
        #touch .gas { left: 75%; width: 25%; border-left: 1dp #ffffff33; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-portrait #order { display: none; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-landscape #order { width: 160dp; top: 18%; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-landscape .row { font-size: 12dp; }
        body.kke-phone .dash { margin-bottom: 96dp; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-portrait .top, body.kke-phone.kke-portrait .dash { width: 190dp; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-portrait #results { width: 94%; left: 3%; margin-left: 0; top: 30%; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-portrait #results .who { width: 42%; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-portrait #results .note { display: none; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-portrait #notice { top: auto; bottom: 32%; left: 5%; width: 90%; }
        /* How to play on a phone: the whole sheet on the screen, each card its title. */
        .phone-only { display: none; }
        body.kke-phone .phone-only { display: block; }
        body.kke-phone #howto .sheet { width: 96%; left: 2%; margin-left: 0; top: 2%; margin-top: 0; height: 96%; }
        body.kke-phone #howto h1 { font-size: 28dp; }
        body.kke-phone #howto .tagline { margin: 2dp 0 8dp 0; font-size: 14dp; }
        body.kke-phone #howto .card { width: 32.5%; height: auto; padding: 6dp 10dp; margin-bottom: 6dp; }
        body.kke-phone.kke-portrait #howto .card { width: 49%; }
        body.kke-phone #howto .card .body { display: none; }
        body.kke-phone #howto .title { font-size: 16dp; margin: 2dp 0 2dp 0; }
        body.kke-phone #howto .go { position: relative; margin-top: 8dp; }
        body.kke-phone #howto .later { display: none; }
        /* How to play. */
        #howto { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background-color: #05070ef2; }
        #howto .sheet { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 960dp; margin-left: -480dp; height: 560dp; margin-top: -290dp; }
        #howto h1 { display: block; font-size: 44dp; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 4dp; }
        #howto .tagline { font-size: 17dp; color: #cfd6e6; text-align: center; margin: 4dp 0 22dp 0; }
        #howto .cards { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; }
        #howto .card { box-sizing: border-box; width: 308dp; height: 190dp; margin-bottom: 16dp; padding: 14dp 16dp; border-radius: 12dp; background-color: #141b2e;
                       border-top: 3dp #56a8ff; }
        #howto .card.hurt { border-top-color: #ff6b5c; }
        #howto .card.slide { border-top-color: #ffcf5c; }
        #howto .step { font-size: 12dp; letter-spacing: 2dp; color: #7f8aa8; }
        #howto .title { font-size: 20dp; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; margin: 2dp 0 8dp 0; }
        #howto .body { font-size: 14dp; color: #cfd6e6; line-height: 1.35; }
        #howto .body img { font-size: 19dp; }
        #howto .go { position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: 100%; text-align: center; font-size: 20dp; color: #ffffff; }
        #howto .go img { font-size: 26dp; }
        #howto .later { font-size: 13dp; color: #7f8aa8; margin-top: 6dp; }
        #howto .later img { font-size: 16dp; }
    </style>
</head>
<body data-model="race">
    <div id="notice" data-if="notice != ''">{{notice}}</div>
    <div data-if="racing">
        <div data-for="p : players">
            <div class="top" data-style-left="p.x" data-style-top="p.y" data-style-border-left-color="p.accent">
                <div class="name">{{p.name}}</div>
                <div class="place">{{p.place}}</div>
                <div class="lap">{{p.lap}}</div>
                <div class="best">{{p.best}}</div>
                <div class="drift" data-if="p.drift != ''">drift points <span>{{p.drift}}</span></div>
                <div class="combo" data-if="p.combo != ''">{{p.combo}}</div>
                <div class="note" data-if="p.note != ''">{{p.note}}</div>
                <div class="status" data-if="p.status != ''">{{p.status}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="dash" data-class-redline="p.redline" data-class-low="p.low" data-style-right="p.r" data-style-bottom="p.b">
                <span class="gear">{{p.gear}}</span>
                <div><span class="speed">{{p.speed}}</span><span class="unit">km/h</span></div>
                <div class="label">REVS</div>
                <div class="bar rpm"><div class="fill" data-style-width="p.rpm" data-style-background-color="p.rpm_color"></div></div>
                <div class="label">CAR</div>
                <div class="bar hp"><div class="fill" data-style-width="p.health" data-style-background-color="p.health_color"></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="order" data-if="standings.size > 1 && results.size == 0 && !howto">
            <div data-for="s : standings" class="row" data-class-you="s.you" data-class-out="s.out"><span class="g">{{s.gap}}</span><span class="p">{{s.place}}</span><span class="dot" data-style-background-color="s.accent"></span>{{s.name}}</div>
        </div>
        <div id="tree" data-if="drag && lights != '' && !howto">
            <div class="bulb amber" data-class-on="lights == 'amber1' || lights == 'amber2' || lights == 'amber3'"></div>
            <div class="bulb amber" data-class-on="lights == 'amber2' || lights == 'amber3'"></div>
            <div class="bulb amber" data-class-on="lights == 'amber3'"></div>
            <div class="bulb green" data-class-on="lights == 'green'"></div>
            <div class="bulb red" data-class-on="lights == 'red'"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="banner" data-if="(banner != '' || sub != '') && !howto">
            <div class="big" data-if="banner != ''">{{banner}}</div>
            <div class="sub" data-if="sub != ''" data-rml="sub"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="results" data-if="results.size > 0 && !howto">
            <div data-for="r : results" class="r"><span class="place">{{r.place}}</span><span class="dot" data-style-background-color="r.accent"></span><span class="who">{{r.name}}</span><span class="what">{{r.result}}</span><span class="note">{{r.note}}</span></div>
        </div>
        <div id="touch" data-if="racing && results.size == 0 && !howto"><div class="steer">STEER</div><div class="brake">BRAKE</div><div class="gas">GAS</div></div>
        <div id="hint" data-if="!howto" data-rml="hint"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="howto" data-if="howto">
        <div class="sheet">
            <h1>RACING</h1>
            <div class="tagline">Oval races, drifting and the drag strip. Bring your car home in one piece.</div>
            <div class="tagline phone-only">Hold the left half of the screen to steer (left or right of its middle), the right edge for gas, next to it the brake.</div>
            <div class="cards">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="step">1 · DRIVE</div>
                    <div class="title">Gas, brake, steer</div>
                    <div class="body"><prompt action="throttle"/> accelerates, <prompt action="brake"/> brakes (held when stopped: reverse), <prompt action="steer"/> steers. <prompt action="look.back"/> looks behind you.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="step">2 · THE OVAL</div>
                    <div class="title">Race the pack</div>
                    <div class="body">Every turn is a left turn, two cars side by side. Brake before the turns, not in them. The first over the line after the last lap wins.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card hurt">
                    <div class="step">3 · DAMAGE</div>
                    <div class="title">Look after your car</div>
                    <div class="body">Hits dent it, bend the wheels and weaken the engine. At 0% it's totalled. The pit lane inside the front straight fixes it: stop in a box.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card slide">
                    <div class="step">4 · DRIFT</div>
                    <div class="title">Slide for points</div>
                    <div class="body">Tap <prompt action="handbrake"/> into a corner and keep the slide going with <prompt action="throttle"/>. The longer and faster, the bigger the combo. A hit loses it.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="step">5 · DRAG</div>
                    <div class="title">Launch on green</div>
                    <div class="body">Three ambers, then green: go! Before green is a red light. Change gear with <prompt action="shift.up"/> at the top of the revs.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="step">IF YOU SPIN</div>
                    <div class="title">Back on the track</div>
                    <div class="body"><prompt action="reset.car"/> puts you back on the road. <prompt action="camera"/> changes the camera.<br/><prompt action="race.again"/> race again · <prompt action="race.new"/> next track · <prompt action="menu"/> menu</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="go"><prompt action="throttle" label="Start"/>
                <div class="later"><prompt action="help" label="shows this again"/></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
